    "description": "No child will fail under the new education reforms - PM Harini",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111131/no-child-will-fail-under-the-new-education-reforms-pm-harini",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
