    "chunk_text": "Gampaha-Colombo private bus owners suspend\u00a0services\n\nPrivate bus services operating from Gampaha to Colombo and several other destinations have been suspended in protest over restrictions on stopping at certain locations, the Gampaha Private Bus Owners\u2019 Association announced."
