    "md5": "65809f2c99334cab4bf52f4abd7c0e6c",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 651,
    "chunk_text": "Under de minimis exemption most well governed countries in Europe and East Asia where people have high levels of economic freedoms and innovation de minimis exemptions of 100 to 150 dollars (or Euro) are given.\n\nUnder de minimis exemption, all taxes border taxes are exempted. Value added tax is charged in most contries.\n\nSince de minimis is an established practice internationally Sri Lanka should also consider an exemption, de Silva said.\n\nA committee appointed by President Anura Kumara Dissanayake is looking into the matter and a decision will be taken in the future, Deputy Industries Minister Chathuranga Abeysinghe said. (Colombo/Aug05/2025)"
