    "description": "South Korea pledges to help companies cope with higher US tariffs",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111183/south-korea-pledges-to-help-companies-cope-with-higher-us-tariffs",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1754372160.0,
