    "description": "Another earthquake hits Russia\u2019s Petropavlovsk region; back-to-back tremors raise alarm",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111186/another-earthquake-hits-russias-petropavlovsk-region-back-to-back-tremors-raise-alarm",
    "lang": "en",
