    "description": "Cabinet approves proposal to appoint new Delimitation Committee",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111191/cabinet-approves-proposal-to-appoint-new-delimitation-committee",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
