    "chunk_text": "Gabbard had declassified documents and said the information she released showed a \u201ctreasonous conspiracy\u201d in 2016 by top Obama officials to undermine Trump, claims that Democrats called false and politically motivated.\n\nThe assessment determined the actual impact was likely limited and showed no evidence that Moscow\u2019s efforts actually changed voting outcomes. Russia has denied it attempted to interfere in U.S. elections."
