    "description": "No special security for Israeli nationals in Sri Lanka \u2013 Cabinet Spokesman",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111196/no-special-security-for-israeli-nationals-in-sri-lanka-cabinet-spokesman",
    "lang": "en",
