    "description": "China donates Rs. 400 mln in disaster relief equipment to Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111203/china-donates-rs-400-mln-in-disaster-relief-equipment-to-sri-lanka-",
    "lang": "en",
