    "description": "Are AI tools making students smarter or lazier? New study warns of hidden risks",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/are-ai-tools-making-students-smarter-or-lazier-new-study-warns-of-hidden-risks/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
