    "description": "Defence Ministry has its say over remanding of former Navy Commander Ulugetenne",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Defence-Ministry-has-its-say-over-remanding-of-former-Navy-Commander-Ulugetenne/14-779939",
