    "description": "Julie Chung urges bold reforms at 9th AGM of SL-USA Business Council",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Julie-Chung-urges-bold-reforms-at-9th-AGM-of-SL-USA-Business-Council/34-779950",
