    "date_str": "2025-08-06",
    "description": "UN official says Israel expanding Gaza operations would risk \u2018catastrophic consequences\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111225/un-official-says-israel-expanding-gaza-operations-would-risk-catastrophic-consequences",
    "lang": "en",
