    "chunk_text": "\u201cWe have already made clear our position on these issues, including the fact that our imports are based on market factors and done with the overall objective of ensuring the energy security of 1.4 billion people of India,\u201d a statement from the government of India said.\n\n\u201cWe reiterate that these actions are unfair, unjustified and unreasonable. India will take all actions necessary to protect its national interests.\u201d\n\nTrump is slamming taxes claiming emergency powers, which has been questioned.  (Colombo/Aug06/2025)"
