    "description": "Mental health concerns rise among schoolchildren, health officials warn",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111255/mental-health-concerns-rise-among-schoolchildren-health-officials-warn",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
