    "description": "Trump to meet Putin in coming days with venue to be announced later, Kremlin says",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111264/trump-to-meet-putin-in-coming-days-with-venue-to-be-announced-later-kremlin-says",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
