    "chunk_text": "Another network of Neurons which forms the Central Executive Network (CEN) a more Task related network is located in the Dorso-lateral Pre-Frontal Cortex. The CEN regulates the DMN. This has been shown to occur via white matter (Connectome) tract called the Uncinate Fasciculus seen in red in Fig:3, below.\n\nDalai Lama has been helpful, to the Waisman Laboratory \u2013Centre for imaging healthy minds in The University of Wisconsin-Madison USA, in bringing Tibetan Monks with over 10,000 hours of Meditation experience for fMRI imaging while meditating. The information so unlocked has allowed to see how core Buddhist- philosophy has a basis in neuroscience. Details of this information is in print in my 150 page book Buddhist Philosophy and Neuroscience, available at all Sarasavi bookshops and BPS-Kandy for Rs 800.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
