    "chunk_size_bytes": 1625,
    "chunk_text": "CameraLK expands to the Eastern Province with the grand opening of its latest showroom in Batticaloa\n\nCameraLK, Sri Lanka\u2019s leading camera retail giant, marked another milestone with the grand opening of its newest showroom in Batticaloa, bringing world-class photography and videography gear to the Eastern Province. This expansion underscores CameraLK\u2019s strategic vision to cater to a wider audience of photography enthusiasts and professionals across Sri Lanka.\n\nThe opening ceremony was graced by Sony Sri Lanka Country Manager, Thomas Sim, alongside Anushka Gunasinghe, Managing Director of CameraLK, and several staff members and well-wishers.\n\nLocated at 496 Trinco Road, Gnasooriyaam Sathukkam, Batticaloa, this brand-new multi-brand showroom is the first of its kind in the city. With spacious interiors, the store offers customers access to the latest trends and premium products all under one roof\u2014 from high-quality DSLR cameras and advanced mirrorless systems to drones, compact point-and-shoot models, and a comprehensive range of accessories. Customers can expect the newest products from top global brands at competitive prices, along with CameraLK\u2019s hallmark excellent customer service.\n\nTo celebrate the launch, CameraLK hosted a special photography workshop in Batticaloa. The event brought together passionate photography enthusiasts for a day filled with inspiring talks, hands-on professional training, and creative exchanges. The workshop received an overwhelming response, with a packed venue and an energized audience, reflecting the strong support and enthusiasm of the Batticaloa community."
