    "chunk_text": "To celebrate the launch, CameraLK hosted a special photography workshop in Batticaloa. The event brought together passionate photography enthusiasts for a day filled with inspiring talks, hands-on professional training, and creative exchanges. The workshop received an overwhelming response, with a packed venue and an energized audience, reflecting the strong support and enthusiasm of the Batticaloa community.\n\nFounded in 2010, CameraLK has rapidly grown to become South Asia\u2019s largest camera retail and online store. Celebrated for its knowledgeable imaging experts, outstanding customer service, and competitive pricing, CameraLK carries over 5,000 products from major manufacturers, including Sony, Canon, Nikon, Sigma, Tamron, Tokina, DJI, GoPro, Profotto, and Wescott. With branches in Colombo, Kandy, Jaffna, and now Batticaloa, as well as a robust online platform at www.cameralk.com, CameraLK continues to be the ultimate destination for camera enthusiasts across Sri Lanka.\n\nICMA Australia hosts insightful session on bridging generational divide in the workplace\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
