    "description": "Vanishing giants: Why Sri Lanka must protect its last wild tuskers \u2014 before it\u2019s too late",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Vanishing-giants-Why-Sri-Lanka-must-protect-its-last-wild-tuskers-before-it-s-too-late/4-780038",
    "lang": "en",
