    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s Billion-Dollar X-Press Pearl Judgment Faces Uphill Legal Battle In Singapore",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/sri-lankas-billion-dollar-x-press-pearl-judgment-faces-uphill-legal-battle-in-singapore/",
