    "description": "Sri Lanka BYD agents say Customs to release detained cars on bank guarantee",
    "url_metadata": "https://economynext.com/sri-lanka-byd-agents-say-customs-to-release-detained-cars-on-bank-guarantee-235324/",
    "lang": "en",
