    "chunk_size_bytes": 1540,
    "chunk_text": "Serendib Flour Mills champions SLIM National Sales Awards 2025 as Official Nutritional Partner\n\nNourishing and supporting professional sales excellence, Serendib Flour Mills Limited (SFML) is partnering the SLIM National Sales Awards 2025 as the Official Nutritional Partner.\n\nSFML is a wholly owned subsidiary of the Dubai-headquartered Al Ghurair, one of the leading diversified family businesses in the United Arab Emirates (UAE). For the past 16 years, SFML has been a trusted cornerstone of Sri Lanka\u2019s food industry, playing a pivotal role in the food security of the country, driven by the overarching purpose of \u2018Nourishing the Nation,\u2019 and\n\nThe partnership was formalized at a ceremony held at the Serendib Flour Mills, corporate office. The event was attended by Vijay Sharma, CEO, Kalinga Wijesekara, Director Brand and Corporate Communication and Faizal Deen, Assistant Manager Brand from Serendib Flour Mills. Enoch Perera, Vice President Events & Sustainability, Chamil Wickremasinghe \u2013 Chief Executive Officer- SLIM, Gangani Liyanage, Head of Events & Sustainability and Avishka Attanayeke, Junior Executive Events & Sustainability represented SLIM.\n\nAnverally and Sons earns prestigious ISO/IEC 17025 international certification for in-house laboratory\n\nLOLC AL-Falaah dominates SLIBFI Awards 2025 with five golden triumphs\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
