    "description": "Sri Lanka expresses deep concern over Israel\u2019s decision on Gaza",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111301/sri-lanka-expresses-deep-concern-over-israels-decision-on-gaza",
    "lang": "en",
