    "description": "K H J Wijayadasa: A rare and exemplary public servant",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/k-h-j-wijayadasa-a-rare-and-exemplary-public-servant/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
