    "description": "Grade 5 Scholarship Exam to be held today",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111315/grade-5-scholarship-exam-to-be-held-today",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
