    "description": "\u201cIndia won\u2019t yield to threats, US not able to digest our growth\u201d: Venkaiah Naidu",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111320/india-wont-yield-to-threats-us-not-able-to-digest-our-growth-venkaiah-naidu",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
