    "description": "Sri Lanka in talks on a voluntary restructure of some residual 2022 ISBs",
    "url_metadata": "https://economynext.com/sri-lanka-in-talks-on-a-voluntary-restructure-of-some-residual-2022-isbs-235443/",
    "lang": "en",
