    "description": "Donald Trump says he will deploy US National Guard in Washington DC",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111370/donald-trump-says-he-will-deploy-us-national-guard-in-washington-dc",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
