    "description": "Do they kill elephants using the App? Why that question misses the point entirely",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/do-they-kill-elephants-using-the-app-why-that-question-misses-the-point-entirely/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
