    "description": "Should MEPA be apportioned major part of blame for X-Press Pearl marine environmental disaster?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Should-MEPA-be-apportioned-major-part-of-blame-for-X-Press-Pearl-marine-environmental-disaster/4-780131",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
