    "description": "Fuel taxes cannot be reduced until loans are fully repaid \u2013 Energy Minister",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111379/fuel-taxes-cannot-be-reduced-until-loans-are-fully-repaid-energy-minister",
    "lang": "en",
