    "description": "Nepal offers free climbs to 97 peaks as tourism to Everest surges",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111384/nepal-offers-free-climbs-to-97-peaks-as-tourism-to-everest-surges",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
