    "description": "Sri Lanka monetary policy balanced, space to cut on an external impact: CB Governor",
    "url_metadata": "https://economynext.com/sri-lanka-monetary-policy-balanced-space-to-cut-on-an-external-impact-cb-governor-235718/",
