    "description": "Why America\u2019s new Crypto regime makes South Asia nervous",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/why-americas-new-crypto-regime-makes-south-asia-nervous/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
