    "description": "Opposition trying to shield real masterminds of Easter attacks: Cabinet Spokesman",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Opposition-trying-to-shield-real-masterminds-of-Easter-attacks-Cabinet-Spokesman/56-780192",
