    "chunk_text": "The new government under Dissanayake has adopted a more constructive and engaged approach toward the United Nations, particularly on issues related to human rights, sustainable development, and climate action.\n\nSri Lanka has recommitted to several UN frameworks, including the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development, and is seeking increased support from UN bodies in areas such as transitional justice, institutional reform, and poverty alleviation. (Colombo/August 13/2025)"
