    "description": "Sri Lanka has opportunity to break from past: T\u00fcrk",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Sri-Lanka-has-opportunity-to-break-from-past-T\u00fcrk/56-780238",
    "lang": "en",
