    "description": "Boat carrying migrants capsizes off Italy, killing at least 26",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111449/boat-carrying-migrants-capsizes-off-italy-killing-at-least-26",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
