    "chunk_text": "Acting Director of Police Cultural Division arrested over bribery allegations\n\nThe Acting Director of the Police Cultural Division, SSP Sathish Gamage has been arrested by the Commission to Investigate Allegations of Bribery or Corruption (CIABOC) over several bribery allegations."
