    "description": "Probe launched after urea fertilizer poured into SLTB bus engine in N\u2019Eliya",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111477/probe-launched-after-urea-fertilizer-poured-into-sltb-bus-engine-in-neliya",
    "lang": "en",
