    "description": "Over 7,000 T-56 ammunition recovered from Getalawa tank",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111478/over-7000-t-56-ammunition-recovered-from-getalawa-tank-",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
