    "description": "UN Rights Chief urges Govt to amend laws that unduly restrict rights and freedoms of Sri Lankans",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111480/un-rights-chief-urges-govt-to-amend-laws-that-unduly-restrict-rights-and-freedoms-of-sri-lankans",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1755181380.0,
    "chunk_id": "2025-08-14-adaderanalk-e317ccec-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
