    "description": "How can Sri Lanka improve its position in the Global Innovation Index?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111482/how-can-sri-lanka-improve-its-position-in-the-global-innovation-index",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
