    "description": "Premier Harini\u2019s gaffe and JVP-led NPP Govt.\u2019s damage control efforts",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Premier-Harini-s-gaffe-and-JVP-led-NPP-Govt-s-damage-control-efforts/4-780290",
