    "description": "Chamber of Marine Industries of Sri Lanka holds AGM, charts course for future growth",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Chamber-of-Marine-Industries-of-Sri-Lanka-holds-AGM-charts-course-for-future-growth/34-780308",
