    "description": "PM Modi to lead India\u2019s 79th Independence Day celebrations",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111484/pm-modi-to-lead-indias-79th-independence-day-celebrations-",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
