    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111487/man-dies-after-being-hit-by-express-train-in-kalutara",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1755224940.0,
    "chunk_id": "2025-08-15-adaderanalk-1b6e9664-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "b2ef2b6eda0de8698554d1c0f191fe7b",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 630,
    "chunk_text": "Man dies after being hit by express train in Kalutara\n\nAn individual has died after being hit by an express train traveling from Maradana to Beliatta.\n\nPolice stated that the incident occurred last night (14) near the 23rd mile post on the Colombo\u2013Beliatta railway line, within the Kalutara North police division.\n\nInvestigations have been initiated by the Kalutara North Police based on information received regarding the incident.\n\nThe identity of the deceased person has not yet been established.\n\nThe body has been placed at the Nagoda Hospital, and further investigations are being carried out by the Kalutara North Police."
  },
