    "description": "Trump to meet Putin today in push for Ukraine peace",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111490/trump-to-meet-putin-today-in-push-for-ukraine-peace",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
