    "description": "President directs officials to prepare plan for creating a sports culture in Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111507/president-directs-officials-to-prepare-plan-for-creating-a-sports-culture-in-sri-lanka",
    "lang": "en",
