    "date_str": "2025-08-15",
    "description": "UNHRC Report On Sri Lanka Details Entrenched & Systemic Rights Violation: UNHRC Should Adopt The Resolution: HRW",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/unhrc-report-on-sri-lanka-details-entrenched-systemic-rights-violation-unhrc-should-adopt-the-resolution-hrw/",
