    "chunk_text": "Finally, we now have a Government that has promised to deliver social, cultural, and economic revival, captured in its central political slogan, \u2018Punarudaya\u2019. I would like to believe that the architects of this vision truly understand its deeper meaning and the implications. Achieving genuine revival requires fresh perspectives, courage, and bold actions. I hope this write-up offers some insight to help guide a meaningful revival in Sri Lanka\u2019s wind energy development."
