    "description": "Govt committed to establish stable policies to drive gem export growth \u2013 PM",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111518/govt-committed-to-establish-stable-policies-to-drive-gem-export-growth-pm",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
