    "description": "Trump says Russia has lost India as an oil client, secondary tariffs will be devastating",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111519/trump-says-russia-has-lost-india-as-an-oil-client-secondary-tariffs-will-be-devastating",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
