    "chunk_size_bytes": 257,
    "chunk_text": "India, the world\u2019s third-largest oil importer, has sharply increased purchases from Russia since the Ukraine war in February 2022. Russian oil, which earlier accounted for less than 0.2 per cent of India\u2019s imports, now makes up 35\u201340% of crude intake."
