    "description": "20% of CEB\u2019s engineers have left for overseas employment",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111521/20-of-cebs-engineers-have-left-for-overseas-employment-",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1755333780.0,
