    "description": "Behind the Scenes of the 1987 UN Human Rights Resolution on Sri Lanka: Power, Politics, and Diplomacy",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/behind-the-scenes-of-the-1987-un-human-rights-resolution-on-sri-lanka-power-politics-and-diplomacy/",
