    "description": "7 killed after cloudburst, landslide in Jammu and Kashmir\u2019s Kathua, rescue ops on",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111551/7-killed-after-cloudburst-landslide-in-jammu-and-kashmirs-kathua-rescue-ops-on",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1755422640.0,
    "chunk_id": "2025-08-17-adaderanalk-0d4041ec-0000",
