    "description": "Rule of law in taxation: Rights before revenue \u2013 Part 2",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Rule-of-law-in-taxation-Rights-before-revenue-Part-2/4-780385",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
