    "md5": "3458b708e0d6e962bcc07a3f725518d2",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 512,
    "chunk_text": "Several spells of showers expected today\n\nSeveral spells of showers will occur in the Western and Sabaragamuwa provinces and in Kandy, Nuwara-Eliya, Galle and Matara districts, the Department of Meteorology said.\n\nMainly fair weather will prevail over elsewhere of the island, the Met. Department added.\n\nMeanwhile, strong winds of about 40-50 kmph can be expected at times over Western slopes of the central hills and in Northern, North-central, North-western and Southern provinces and in Trincomalee district."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
