    "description": "At least 20 killed, 134 people injured in blast at factory in Russia\u2019s Ryazan region",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111586/at-least-20-killed-134-people-injured-in-blast-at-factory-in-russias-ryazan-region",
    "lang": "en",
