    "description": "Strike will continue until demands are met \u2013 Postal Trade Unions",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111602/strike-will-continue-until-demands-are-met-postal-trade-unions",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
