    "description": "US launches inaugural Young South Asian Leaders Initiative workshop in Colombo",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111604/us-launches-inaugural-young-south-asian-leaders-initiative-workshop-in-colombo",
    "lang": "en",
