    "description": "Trump once again claims he stopped India, Pakistan war",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111619/trump-once-again-claims-he-stopped-india-pakistan-war",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
