    "description": "Govt mulls using QR code to disburse fertilizer subsidies to farmers",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111632/govt-mulls-using-qr-code-to-disburse-fertilizer-subsidies-to-farmers",
    "lang": "en",
