    "description": "Details of UK\u2019s liberalised trade rules for Sri Lankan garment sector released",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111648/details-of-uks-liberalised-trade-rules-for-sri-lankan-garment-sector-released",
