    "description": "Trump says Putin may not want to make a deal on Ukraine",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111649/trump-says-putin-may-not-want-to-make-a-deal-on-ukraine",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1755618360.0,
