    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s energy crossroads: From crisis to clean powerhouse",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Sri-Lanka-s-energy-crossroads-From-crisis-to-clean-powerhouse/4-780471",
