    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s JAAF welcomes UK\u2019s liberalised trade rules of origin for apparel exports",
    "url_metadata": "https://economynext.com/sri-lankas-jaaf-welcomes-uks-liberalised-trade-rules-of-origin-for-apparel-exports-237450/",
    "lang": "en",
