    "description": "Can Sri Lanka be \u201cChina Plus One\u201d country for Japanese investors?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Can-Sri-Lanka-be-China-Plus-One-country-for-Japanese-investors/4-780493",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
