    "description": "US launches inaugural Young South Asian Leaders Initiative workshop in Colombo",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/US-launches-inaugural-Young-South-Asian-Leaders-Initiative-workshop-in-Colombo/56-780517",
    "lang": "en",
