    "date_str": "2025-08-21",
    "description": "Israeli military says first stages of assault on Gaza City have begun",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111688/israeli-military-says-first-stages-of-assault-on-gaza-city-have-begun",
    "lang": "en",
