    "description": "Presidential Investigation Committee on irregularities at SriLankan Airlines & AASL invites public complaints, views and proposals",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111699/presidential-investigation-committee-on-irregularities-at-srilankan-airlines-aasl-invites-public-complaints-views-and-proposals-",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
