    "description": "Chinese scientists battling to save finless porpoise from brink of extinction",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111707/chinese-scientists-battling-to-save-finless-porpoise-from-brink-of-extinction",
    "lang": "en",
